  "notes": "ぶつける means to hit something against something else, or to direct emotions at someone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦ぶつかる→ぶつかる：02412_butsukaru⟧ (intransitive, to collide)\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n1. Physical: to strike against, bump\n2. Figurative: to direct (emotions) at someone\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{頭|あたま}→頭：00574_atama⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ぶつける: to bump one's head\n- ⟦{車|くるま}→車：00516_kuruma⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ぶつける: to hit with a car\n- ⟦{怒|いか}り→怒り：01780_ikari⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ぶつける: to vent anger\n- ⟦{気持|きも}ち→気持ち：01385_kimochi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ぶつける: to express feelings\n- ⟦{不満|ふまん}→不満：02497_fuman⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ぶつける: to voice complaints to\n- ⟦{八|や}つ{当|あ}たり→八つ当たり：08362_yatsuatari⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ぶつける: to take frustrations out on\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦ぶつかる→ぶつかる：02412_butsukaru⟧: to collide with (intransitive)\n- ⟦{当|あ}たる→当たる：01860_ataru⟧: to hit, strike",
